<view class="page">
  <view class="section">学年</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>当前学年</text>
      <text class="value">{{year}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="line">
      <text>下一学年</text>
      <input class="input" value="{{nextYear}}" bindinput="onNextYear" />
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onArchive">切换学年</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section">任命</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>任命新主席</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        type="number"
        maxlength="10"
        placeholder="10 位学号"
        value="{{chairmanNo}}"
        bindinput="onChairmanNo"
      />
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onAppointChairman">任命为主席</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>任命新部长</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        type="number"
        maxlength="10"
        placeholder="10 位学号"
        value="{{ministerNo}}"
        bindinput="onMinisterNo"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="line">
      <text>所属部门</text>
      <picker range="{{depts}}" range-key="label" value="{{deptIndex}}" bindchange="onDept">
        <view class="value">{{depts[deptIndex].label}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onAppointMinister">任命为部长</button>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    主席从部长中任命，部长从小干中任命；任命可多人，不会降级现任成员；任命后会向对方发送站内消息。学年切换只改统计口径，不会删除历史数据。
  </view>
</view>
